  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="ability-h">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2 id="ability-h">模型可以有很多个，验收线只要一条。</h2>
        <p>Veriforge 不训练模型、不封装提示词，它只做一件事：让「任务完成」这句话有客观标准。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bento">
        <article class="card span-4 card-flush reveal">
          <div>
            <div class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#tree-structure"></use></svg></div>
            <h3>完成判定权归 Harness 所有</h3>
            <p>状态流转、预算、验证与证据收集由纯代码 Harness 独占，Coding Runtime 只被调用、永不裁决。强类型合法迁移表禁止跳步与回跳，终态不可逆。</p>
          </div>
          <p class="card-link"><a class="link-more" href="/project#advantage">看状态机设计<svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#arrow-right"></use></svg></a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="card span-2 reveal">
          <div class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#git-branch"></use></svg></div>
          <h3>Git Worktree 物理隔离</h3>
          <p>每次运行独立 detached worktree，环境变量白名单过滤，绝不污染源仓库与其他 Worker。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card span-2 reveal">
          <div class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#shield-check"></use></svg></div>
          <h3>受保护验证</h3>
          <p>全量验证前强制恢复 Base Commit 的原始测试执行，封存模型对测试的一切改动。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card span-2 reveal">
          <div class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#fingerprint"></use></svg></div>
          <h3>稳定失败指纹</h3>
          <p>SHA-256 归一化指纹让同因失败无所遁形：连续无进展即熔断，不给无效循环烧钱。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card span-2 reveal">
          <div class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/img/icons.svg#rocket-launch"></use></svg></div>
          <h3>事务化交付</h3>
          <p>完成判定与交付请求同事务落库，GitHub PR 幂等创建，网络未知状态先对账再重试。</p>
        </article>
